@ShopOn.Services.CartingService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5133


### POST cartitem
POST {{ShopOn.Services.CartingService_HostAddress}}/cartitems
accept: */*
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "CartId":"257A05F7-467E-4472-AD02-C427869A3796",
  "Name":"Test Item 1",
  "Image":"x.png",
  "Price":213.45,
  "Quantity":5,
  "StatusId":"Some Status Id"
}

### GET cartitems
GET {{ShopOn.Services.CartingService_HostAddress}}/cartitems/
Accept: application/json


### DELETE /cartitems/{cartid}/{id} deletes a cart item
DELETE {{ShopOn.Services.CartingService_HostAddress}}/cartitems/257A05F7-467E-4472-AD02-C427869A3796/7a35ace3-f2f2-4023-9e13-597b5668003f/
Accept: application/json